{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28913","headline":"江西郑常侍赴镇之日有寄因酬和 · 许浑","name":"江西郑常侍赴镇之日有寄因酬和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来暮亦何愁，金貂在鷁舟。\n斾随寒浪动，帆带夕阳收。\n布令滕王阁，裁诗郢客楼。\n即应归凤沼，中外赞天休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}